              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddiiba markuu boqor noqday ayuu wada laayay reerkii Yaaraabcaam oo dhan, oo Yaaraabcaam uma uu dayn qof keliya oo neefsada, laakiinse wuu wada baabbi'iyey, sidii uu ahaa eraygii Rabbigu u soo dhiibay addoonkiisii Axiiyaah kii reer Shiiloh; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, waxay saas u noqotay Yaaraabcaam dembiyadiisii uu dembaabay, oo uu dadkii Israa'iilna dembaajiyey, iyo xanaaqii uu ka xanaajiyey Rabbiga ah Ilaaha dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
