        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah, oo wuxuu ku socday jidkii aabbihiis Yaaraabcaam, iyo dembigiisii uu dadkii Israa'iilna dembaajiyey.",
